=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Detail shoes<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>shoes<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\r\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/detail/2\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Detail shoes<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>shoes<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"url-parameter-문법을-사용하자-링크걸기\" style=\"position:relative;\">URL parameter 문법을 사용하자! 링크걸기<a href=\"#url-parameter-%EB%AC%B8%EB%B2%95%EC%9D%84-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%ED%95%98%EC%9E%90-%EB%A7%81%ED%81%AC%EA%B1%B8%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"url parameter 문법을 사용하자 링크걸기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>페이지를 여러개 만들고 싶으면 URL parameter 문법을 사용할 수 있다.<br>\npath 작명할 때  /:작명 이렇게 사용하면 /detail/작명 으로 접속했을때 해당 컴포넌트를 보여준다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Route path<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"/detail/:id\"</span> element<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>Detail shoes<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>shoes<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"url-parameter-가져오기\" style=\"position:relative;\">URL parameter 가져오기<a href=\"#url-parameter-%EA%B0%80%EC%A0%B8%EC%98%A4%EA%B8%B0\" aria-label=\"url parameter 가져오기 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>(참고)<br>\npath 작명시 url 파라미터는 몇번이고 사용가능합니다. detail/:어쩌구/:저쩌구 가능</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber 